# Real, trained-and-evaluated enhanced/ BiLSTM artifacts (~29MB total) -
# shipped deliberately so the repo/demo work without a separate training
# step. Root-layer weights (Transformer + GloVe) are NOT shipped - see
# their own note in the root README.
!enhanced/saved_models/toxicity_model.keras
!enhanced/saved_models/tokenizer.pickle
!enhanced/saved_models/config.pickle
# Same model, re-saved in HDF5 format and copied to where
# src/toxicity_redactor.py's load_pretrained_model() looks by default, so
# the root Flask app runs in 'trained' mode out of the box. See its own
# README note on memory: this pushes the deployed app's RSS to ~718MB,
# over a 512MB free-tier host's budget - verified locally, not theoretical.
!src/saved_models/demo_toxicity_classifier.h5
!src/saved_models/config.pickle
!src/tokenizer.pickle
.env
